{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17557","headline":"和权载之离合诗 · 武少仪","name":"和权载之离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年慕时彦，小悟文多变。\n木铎比羣英，八方流德声。\n雷陈美交契，雨雪音尘继。\n恩顾各飞翔，因诗覩瑰丽。\n傅野绝遗贤，人希有盛迁。\n早钦风与雅，日咏赠酬篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武少仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}